---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Docs — wg" description="wg documentation — guides, concepts, and reference for task coordination with humans and AI agents.">

  <header class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-50 leading-tight mb-4">Documentation</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary">
      Guides, concepts, and reference for coordinating humans and AI agents with task graphs.
    </p>
  </header>

  <hr class="gradient-divider" />

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">

    <a href="/docs/getting-started/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Getting Started
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Install wg, initialize a project, create tasks, and start the service.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/workflow-patterns/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Workflow Patterns
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Four patterns for agentic work: service mode, agent plans, mixed human+AI, and manual.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/verification/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Verification Workflow
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Automated quality assurance with FLIP scoring — verify agent work without human review.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/service/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Service Management
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Configure and manage the coordinator daemon, agents, model selection, and runtime settings.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/agency/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Agency System
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Composable identities — roles, tradeoffs, evaluation, and evolution.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/tui/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        TUI Guide
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Interactive terminal dashboard — views, keybindings, and navigation.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/commands/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        Command Reference
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Every wg command at a glance — task management, service, agency, and utilities.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/ai-integration/" class="block border-b border-border-primary pb-6 group">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-50 group-hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors mb-2">
        AI Assistant Integration
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">Set up Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, and other AI assistants with wg.</p>
    </a>

  </div>

</DocsLayout>
